  "private": true,
  "description": "Pure, platform-agnostic domain core. ZERO node/react/fs/dom deps so it runs unchanged in the Cloudflare Worker (apps/web), React Native (apps/mobile), and the desktop renderer. `src/knowledge/` is the link graph, search and projection engine over a vault; `src/markdown/` is the remark parse pipeline and the MDX vocabulary gate. No I/O, no clock, no crypto — the caller injects them.",
